        "description": "Saphentite (Sapphee) is a member of the lamia species; a half humanoid, half serpent, monster. She herself suffers from albinism, and therefore takes precautions such as wearing sun-resistant clothing, covering her face in a veil, and sometimes utilizing an umbrella.\n\nShe works with [Dr. Glenn](https://anilist.co/character/151234/Litbeit-Glenn) at the Litbeit clinic as a fellow doctor, but is usually content to resign herself to the status of Dr. Glenn's personal assistant.",
